37	 * is the only triangle and the only one with a melody — the home is the one place
38	 * in this chapter that sings. Everything at the audit site is the same square
39	 * fifth-and-tritone colour, and the four survey moods differ ONLY in their
40	 * pattern: demonstration thins the home's pulse to two hits, refusal empties the
41	 * bar entirely (refusal as subtraction, the ch4-comply law), revision puts the
42	 * tritone back on the offbeat, and the settled ending adds the fifth on the last
43	 * eighth. Nothing gets louder; the spacing changes.
44	 */
