440	 * Ask the signed AV rail to activate an anchor, and REMEMBER A REFUSAL.
441	 *
442	 * The rail is entered by the shared story director AFTER each chapter's own
443	 * beat-entry seam (`emergentStoryDirector`: `enterCommonGroundBeat(beat)` then
444	 * `enterSignedSceneAvBeat(beat)`), so an anchor published at entry is offered
