446	 * The old code discarded that boolean while having already spent this module's
447	 * one-shot latch, so `anc.cg.home-steady` could never activate at all — on a
448	 * hydrated entry, on a deep link, or in a continuous journey. Measured
449	 * (VF-ANCHOR-OBS-1): both real F acts performed, both milestones set, the
450	 * activation history empty.
451	 *
452	 * A refusal is not a fact that stopped being true. It is queued, in the order
